OL,3,ATeenager arrested after four viable
OL,4,Adevices found in security alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy has been arrested
OL,7,Funder the Terrorism Act after a
OL,8,Fsecurity alert in Omagh, County Tyrone.
OL,10,FPolice carried out a planned search on
OL,11,FMonday at an address in the Gardenville
OL,12,FAvenue.
OL,14,FPolice said four viable explosive
OL,15,Fdevices were found and removed from the
OL,16,Fproperty for forensic examination.
OL,18,FNearby residents who had been asked to
OL,19,Fleave their homes during the alert have
OL,20,Fsince returned.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
